/*
 *  Fast C2P (Chunky-to-Planar) Conversion
 *
 *  Copyright (C) 2003 Geert Uytterhoeven
 *
 *  NOTES:
 *    - This code was inspired by Scout's C2P tutorial
 *    - It assumes to run on a big endian system
